Fernbrook Parish Notes

What changed in the village this fortnight.

Orchard walk
Saplings planted along the east path; volunteers meet at the gate at nine.

Cider press
The press is mended and the first pressing is booked for the twelfth.

Library hours
The reading room stays open until eight on Thursdays from next week.

Map archive
Sixty survey sheets of the valley are now scanned and free to browse.

Ferry notice
The morning crossing moves to quarter past seven while the jetty is resurfaced.

Harbour lights
New lamps line the slipway, dimmed after midnight for the bats.

